AGENTS.md

# Document-build page renders and draft PDF copies under docs/research/*/.work/.
# ~36MB of PNGs plus superseded revisions of a PDF that IS committed; both are
# reproducible from the build scripts and source markdown kept beside them.
docs/research/**/render/
docs/research/**/*-render/
